{
  "svertik": "project",
  "version": 1,
  "name": "Time Remap",
  "canvas": "#F2E8DA",
  "scene": {
    "version": 1,
    "document": {
      "width": 1500,
      "height": 750
    },
    "objects": [
      {
        "kind": "group",
        "id": "remap-0",
        "name": "Freeze & rewind",
        "children": [],
        "stack": [],
        "transform": {
          "x": -450,
          "scale": 0.3
        },
        "composition": {
          "scene": {
            "version": 1,
            "document": {
              "width": 1280,
              "height": 900
            },
            "notes": "Círculo centrado en un canvas de 1280×900, de color #D2502F. Damage con cinco cortes Through, seguido de Explosion y Gravity con cuerpos rígidos. Al inicio el círculo está centrado; los cortes crecen entre 0.4 y 1.1 s, recibe el impulso de Explosion entre 1.2 y 1.24 s y Gravity integra la velocidad de salida y el giro desde 1.2 s. Explosión muy enérgica (fuerza 3, giro 900°/s), con dispersión amplia: muchas piezas salen deliberadamente del encuadre y conservan su inercia. El suelo virtual queda en Y=378. Selecciona Gravity para mover o girar el suelo. Usa los controles inferiores para reproducir sin abrir el timeline. Las piezas colisionan con el suelo, no entre sí. BOOM aparece detrás de los fragmentos, en mayúsculas y del mismo color #D2502F, con una entrada casi simultánea muy rápida, de 1.26 a 1.44 s, y un pequeño rebote. Queda grande y centrado (tamaño de texto 400 px). Circle hace una pequeña anticipación de escala antes de estallar (0.94 → 1.06 → 1), con retorno suave a escala normal hasta 1.42 s. Confetti emite una ráfaga de 200 partículas de #D2502F al estallar, con giro rápido, caída y desvanecimiento; se oculta antes de 1.2 s.",
            "objects": [
              {
                "kind": "shape",
                "id": "gravity-circle",
                "name": "Circle",
                "shape": "ellipse",
                "params": {
                  "width": 420,
                  "height": 420,
                  "fill": true,
                  "fillColor": "#D2502F",
                  "stroke": false
                },
                "transform": {
                  "x": 0,
                  "y": 0
                },
                "stack": [
                  {
                    "id": "gravity-circle-damage",
                    "type": "damage",
                    "params": {
                      "seed": 12,
                      "growth": {
                        "$expr": "clamp((scene.time - 0.4) / 0.7, 0, 1)",
                        "fallback": 0
                      },
                      "through": 5,
                      "cracks": 5,
                      "width": 0.007,
                      "jagged": 0.45,
                      "roughness": 0.25,
                      "chips": 0,
                      "specks": 0
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "gravity-circle-explosion",
                    "type": "explosion",
                    "params": {
                      "motion": "impulse",
                      "amount": {
                        "$expr": "clamp((scene.time - 1.2) / 0.04, 0, 1)",
                        "fallback": 0
                      },
                      "force": 3,
                      "spin": 900,
                      "shrink": 0,
                      "chaos": 0.8,
                      "seed": 7,
                      "center": [
                        0.5,
                        0.5
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "gravity-circle-gravity",
                    "type": "gravity",
                    "params": {
                      "time": {
                        "$expr": "max(0, scene.time - 1.2)",
                        "fallback": 0
                      },
                      "gravity": 1.6,
                      "floor": [
                        0.5,
                        1.4
                      ],
                      "rotation": 0,
                      "physics": true,
                      "friction": 0.55,
                      "bounce": 0.35
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "kind": "shape",
                "id": "gravity-confetti",
                "name": "Confetti",
                "shape": "rectangle",
                "params": {
                  "width": 420,
                  "height": 147,
                  "fill": true,
                  "fillColor": "#D2502F",
                  "stroke": false
                },
                "transform": {
                  "x": 0,
                  "y": 0
                },
                "stack": [
                  {
                    "id": "gravity-confetti-particles",
                    "type": "particles",
                    "params": {
                      "time": {
                        "$expr": "max(0, scene.time - 1.2)",
                        "fallback": 0
                      },
                      "emission": "burst",
                      "count": 60,
                      "lifetime": 3.4,
                      "emitter": "point",
                      "center": [
                        0.5,
                        0.5
                      ],
                      "motion": "free",
                      "direction": -90,
                      "spread": 260,
                      "speed": 2.1,
                      "speedRandom": 0.55,
                      "spin": 650,
                      "gravity": 1.2,
                      "size": 0.03,
                      "sizeRandom": 0.55,
                      "fade": 0.35,
                      "seed": 23
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "gravity-confetti-reveal",
                    "type": "opacity",
                    "params": {
                      "opacity": {
                        "$expr": "clamp((scene.time - 1.2) / 0.035, 0, 1)",
                        "fallback": 0
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "kind": "shape",
                "id": "gravity-boom",
                "name": "Boom",
                "shape": "text",
                "params": {
                  "text": "BOOM",
                  "font": "JetBrains Mono",
                  "weight": 700,
                  "size": 400,
                  "tracking": -45,
                  "align": "center",
                  "fill": true,
                  "fillColor": "#D2502F",
                  "stroke": false
                },
                "transform": {
                  "x": 0,
                  "y": 0
                },
                "stack": [
                  {
                    "id": "gravity-boom-entrance",
                    "type": "stagger",
                    "params": {
                      "progress": {
                        "$expr": "clamp((scene.time - 1.26) / 0.18, 0, 1)",
                        "fallback": 0
                      },
                      "direction": "in",
                      "stagger": 0.06,
                      "ease": "back-out",
                      "order": "forward"
                    },
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "id": "gravity-boom-rise",
                        "type": "transform",
                        "params": {
                          "y": 25,
                          "rotation": -5,
                          "scale": 0.5
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "gravity-boom-fade",
                        "type": "opacity",
                        "params": {
                          "opacity": 0
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "animation": {
              "duration": 8,
              "fps": 30,
              "loop": true,
              "autoplay": true,
              "tracks": [
                {
                  "id": "gravity-circle-anticipation",
                  "node": "gravity-circle",
                  "on": "node",
                  "param": "scale",
                  "keys": [
                    {
                      "t": 0,
                      "value": 1,
                      "ease": "linear"
                    },
                    {
                      "t": 0.78,
                      "value": 1,
                      "ease": "ease-in"
                    },
                    {
                      "t": 1.04,
                      "value": 0.94,
                      "ease": "ease-out"
                    },
                    {
                      "t": 1.17,
                      "value": 1.06,
                      "ease": "ease-in-out"
                    },
                    {
                      "t": 1.42,
                      "value": 1
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "markers": [
                {
                  "id": "local-impact",
                  "name": "Explosion",
                  "t": 1.24
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "params": {
            "time": 0,
            "frameRate": 0,
            "loop": "hold"
          }
        }
      },
